1
00:00:00,834 --> 00:00:03,044
(Penny:)So you're okay?

2
00:00:03,211 --> 00:00:04,921
(Howard:)Hey, I'm a big boy.

3
00:00:05,088 --> 00:00:09,548
(Howard:)I'm not traumatized by some random
comment from some random woman.

4
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:13,348
(Howard:)I mean, get over yourself.

5
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:17,095
(Penny:)Okay. Well...

6
00:00:17,684 --> 00:00:19,184
(Howard:)...bye.

7
00:00:21,646 --> 00:00:23,646
[HOWARD SOBBING]

8
00:00:25,942 --> 00:00:28,032
(Penny:)So close.

9
00:00:30,238 --> 00:00:33,238
[CRASHING ON COMPUTER]

10
00:00:34,576 --> 00:00:37,996
(Leonard:)Oh, my God. That's Kripke's robot?

11
00:00:38,163 --> 00:00:39,833
KRIPKE [ON COMPUTER]:
As you can see...

12
00:00:39,998 --> 00:00:42,958
...the Crippler is reducing
the Chevy Cavalier to rubble.

13
00:00:43,919 --> 00:00:45,589
(Raj:)I can't watch anymore.

14
00:00:45,754 --> 00:00:48,594
- Sheldon, we have to call it off.
- We don't have that option.

15
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:51,847
(Sheldon:)We've accepted the challenge.
We can't run away from a fight.

16
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:55,760
(Leonard:)Oh, please. We've spent our whole lives
running away from fights.

17
00:00:55,931 --> 00:00:59,641
(Leonard:)Personally, I can squeeze through
a hole in a fence half my size.

